      "title": "Qwen built in",
      "detail": "The January 2026 desktop version uses Qwen as its core AI engine with a floating ball assistant."
    },
    {
      "title": "Cloud drive",
      "detail": "Quark Cloud Drive is built in, with up to 6 TB of storage per its description."
    },
    {
      "title": "Scanner and study tools",
      "detail": "AI document scanning, learning and writing tools."
    },
    {
