      "title": "China-centric",
      "detail": "Mostly used and supported in China; reviews call it less relevant elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "title": "Account required for key features",
      "detail": "The desktop version needs a QR login from the phone app for drive and scanner features."
    },
    {
      "title": "Opaque privacy",
      "detail": "AI features send data to Alibaba services; independent privacy review is limited."
    }
